  "content": "<div>看看电商独立站</div>\n<div>图片类网站，从 Pinterest 过来的流量还是很可观的</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>流量来源可以是多种多样的\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>搜索引擎是流量流量，短视频平台更是，而且短视频平台可以快速放大流量。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>那就试试</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原来Pinterest 也可以当作社交平台去维护运营账号。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8kqy56jab4_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>那么图片站都可以这样玩了</div>\n<div>不过归根结底还是要回到交易，回到赚钱上来。</div>",
